                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I discovered this eatery thanks to ChatGPT (asked for recommendations of eateries around the area I was staying) and it did not disappoint. I ordered a large beef noodle soup and it was very good. It came with thick but tender slabs of beef. I also ordered a fried tofu dish which was tasty as well.\n\nThey have an English menu. The staff are also very hospitable and assisted me as I made my order.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
